      "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
      "body": "<!-- ccr-overview-v2 -->\n\n### 🟢 Approval recommended\n\nThe narrowly scoped path and documentation changes are consistent, with no unresolved findings.\n\n**0 open findings**\n\n<details>\n<summary><strong>What changed in this PR</strong></summary>\n\nAligns the Zebra conversion, evaluation, and chat defaults with the supported KDA + MLA architecture.\n\n**Changes:**\n- Switches conversion to the KDA checkpoint and aligns downstream paths.\n- Corrects the model docstring without changing model behavior.\n\n| File | Description |\r\n| ---- | ----------- |\r\n| tools/​hybrid/​run_zebra_eval.sh | Evaluates the updated KDA output directory. |\r\n| tools/​hybrid/​modeling_zebra_llama.py | Clarifies supported blocks and legacy config fields. |\r\n| tools/​hybrid/​convert_zebra_llama_to_hf.sh | Selects the KDA checkpoint and documents alternative converters. |\r\n| tools/​hybrid/​chat_zebra_llama.py | Aligns the chat default and documentation with conversion output. |\n</details>\n\n🧠 **Review effort:** Balanced\n\n---\n\n💡 <a href=\"/AMD-AGI/Primus/new/main?filename=.github/skills/code-review/SKILL.md\" class=\"Link--inTextBlock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Add a `code-review` agent skill</a> or configure MCP servers for context-aware, tailored reviews. <a href=\"https://docs.github.com/copilot/how-tos/use-copilot-agents/request-a-code-review/use-code-review?tool=webui#mcp-servers-and-agent-skills\" class=\"Link--inTextBlock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Learn more in the docs.</a>",
